&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive AI Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Utilise the latest AI technology to automate and personalise the customer experience and champion agent productivity tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foster Client Partnerships:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Act as the senior product counterpart to client stakeholders (such as ENGIE), leading workshops and translating their needs into scalable capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
