&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh serves millions of customers weekly across 18 business units and 8 brands worldwide. At the heart of our product is a belief that every customer deserves a menu that feels like it was made for them, the right meals, at the right time, for the right person. We call it the Sous Chef vision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As &lt;strong&gt;Senior PM II on the Personalization Experience team&lt;/strong&gt;, you own what makes that vision real and&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;felt&lt;/em&gt;. You&#39;re not building the ranking algorithm, you&#39;re building the experiences that make customers trust it, the data collection that makes it smart, and the moments where someone thinks: &lt;em&gt;this app actually knows me&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-autonomy role at the intersection of consumer UX, engineering, and ML systems. The problems are genuinely hard, the scale is real, and the decisions are yours to make.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Food Profile Quality &amp;amp; Signal Collection:&lt;/strong&gt; The food profile is the raw material that powers everything downstream. Your job is to move customers from &quot;fields filled in&quot; to truly Personalization-Ready: high-signal, validated, actionable. You&#39;ll own and iterate on the collection experiences that give our models the data they need to perform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The &quot;Sous Chef&quot; Feel &amp;amp; Transparency:&lt;/strong&gt; You build the moments where personalization becomes tangible, the places where we tell customers &lt;em&gt;why&lt;/em&gt; certain meals were chosen for them. This isn&#39;t just UX work, it&#39;s trust infrastructure for the entire personalization stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Org Data Supplier&lt;/strong&gt;: You&#39;re the clean, reliable interface between raw signal and downstream experience, owning the explanation payloads and API contracts that make it all work at scale. You operate across organizational boundaries and align on shared metrics without needing to own the surfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Native Discovery&lt;/strong&gt; You use GenAI tools actively to compress discovery-to-decision cycles, synthesizing global customer signals, stress-testing hypotheses, and arriving at decision-ready specs faster than traditional PM workflows allow. You don&#39;t treat AI as a novelty; it&#39;s a genuine speed and quality multiplier in your daily practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Long-Horizon Strategy&lt;/strong&gt; You manage your domain with real autonomy. You run a flywheel: better profile data → better models → more visible personalization → more signal back to personalization. You own the strategy and sequencing, not just the backlog, thinking 12–18 months out and making the calls that shape the direction of the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep personalization or data-collection PM experience.&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of PM experience, with meaningful time on user-facing personalization or data collection products, ideally where the UX &lt;em&gt;is&lt;/em&gt; the data pipeline, and where you&#39;ve shipped for both end customers and downstream data consumers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong product taste and customer-facing craft.&lt;/strong&gt; You have a genuine feel for what makes a consumer experience compelling, trustworthy, and sticky, not just functional. You&#39;ve built products at scale where millions of people interact with what you ship, and you hold a high bar for the details: the copy, the interaction pattern, the moment of delight. You know the difference between a feature that works and one that earns trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-native.&lt;/strong&gt; You query your own data (SQL/Python), define your own input/output KPIs, and hold your own in deep-dive technical discussions without needing a data analyst to translate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-org credibility.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ve shipped products across organizational boundaries, aligning on shared metrics, maintaining clean contracts with engineering partners, and navigating competing priorities without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experimentation with healthy skepticism.&lt;/strong&gt; You design experiments to validate hypotheses and know how to interpret results without over-indexing on noise. You&#39;ve made hard calls to kill features based on data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional communicator.&lt;/strong&gt; You can make a complex algorithmic concept legible to a non-technical VP and you can write a spec that engineers can actually ship from.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The AI edge.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ve already incorporated AI-assisted workflows into your daily practice to increase speed, depth of insight, and output quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with a German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Services Senior Project Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;France (Remote)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department:&lt;/strong&gt; Professional Services (PS)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Job&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik Professional Services is looking for a high-energy, strategic, and results-driven &lt;strong&gt;Senior Project Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to lead complex, enterprise customer implementations and help shape the future of our delivery practice. In this role, you will be customer-facing, acting as a trusted advisor to ensure deployment success, business value realisation, and operational efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own high-stakes client engagements end-to-end, bringing deep project management expertise to solve problems on the ground and drive customer outcomes with minimal oversight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Project Manager in our PS Organisation, you will drive impact primarily through hands-on delivery excellence, leadership, and practice enablement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;1. Project &amp;amp; Client Delivery Excellence&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Complex Engagements: Lead end-to-end delivery of complex, concurrent, enterprise-level customer projects from kickoff to sign-off within fast-paced environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scope &amp;amp; Milestone Management: Prepare enterprise customers for deployment, establish clear success criteria, track deliverables, set targets, manage resources, and ensure project execution adheres to deadlines and budgets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Risk &amp;amp; Issue Governance: Proactively identify, track, and mitigate project risks and technical dependencies, resolving issues autonomously before they escalate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholder Alignment: Serve as the single point of contact and escalation owner for customer executives, cross-functional internal teams (Engineering, Customer Support, Sales), and third-party partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quality &amp;amp; Performance: Execute quality control throughout project lifecycles to ensure deliverables meet or exceed Rubrik&#39;s standards and customer business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;2. PMO &amp;amp; Process Optimisation&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with PS leadership to help build, refine, and maintain the PMO governance framework, including standard operating procedures, project methodologies, and key performance indicators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous Improvement: Flag bottlenecks and recommend improvements that enhance operational efficiency, margins, and customer satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in establishing best practices for your engagements, resource allocation, utilisation tracking, and project health reporting across the PS portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of direct Project Management experience delivering customer-facing, enterprise technical projects within a Professional Services or Consulting organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience with managing customers from Financial Services, Government, Healthcare industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of managing multiple complex, high-visibility client engagements concurrently in a fast-paced technology environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to work autonomously, exercising strong judgment and decision-making in ambiguous, high-pressure customer situations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert knowledge of modern project management tools (e.g., Smartsheet, Jira, Confluence, Asana) as well as Google Workspace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent written and spoken French and English skills is must.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional executive communication, stakeholder management, negotiation, and conflict resolution skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good to Have Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognised credentials like Project Management Professional (PMP), PRINCE2, knowledge of Agile/Scrum (CSM, PMI-ACP), or Lean frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Background: Prior hands-on experience or foundational knowledge in Data Management, Cloud Infrastructure (AWS, Azure, GCP), Data Protection, Enterprise Storage, Cybersecurity, or SaaS delivery is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial acumen regarding professional services metrics (e.g., revenue recognition, margin, utilisation, project profitability).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to PMO governance practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik Professional Services transforms possibilities into outcomes. Our portfolio of services uncovers and exploits the unique opportunities made possible by Rubrik technology. Drawing on our unparalleled product expertise and customer experiences, we collaborate with customers to identify and address complex technical challenges, improve operational efficiency, and maximize their investment in Rubrik.&amp;nbsp;We are 100% focused on customer success, operational excellence, and empowering our team members to grow, lead, and innovate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join Us in Securing and Accelerating the World&#39;s AI Transformation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik (RBRK), the Security and AI Operations Company, leads at the intersection of data protection, cyber resilience, and enterprise AI acceleration. Rubrik Security Cloud delivers complete cyber resilience by securing, monitoring, and recovering data, identities, and workloads across clouds. Rubrik Agent Cloud accelerates trusted AI agent deployments at scale by monitoring and auditing agentic actions, enforcing real-time guardrails, fine-tuning for accuracy and undoing agentic mistakes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/rubrik-inc/mycompany/verification/&quot;&gt;Linkedin&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/rubrikinc&quot;&gt;X (formerly Twitter)&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/rubrikinc/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rubrik.com&quot;&gt;Rubrik.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Inclusion @ Rubrik&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Rubrik, we are dedicated to fostering a culture where people from all backgrounds are valued, feel they belong, and believe they can succeed. Our commitment to inclusion is at the heart of our mission to secure the world’s data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to hire and promote the best talent, regardless of background. We continually review our hiring practices to ensure fairness and strive to create an environment where every employee has equal access to opportunities for growth and excellence. We believe in empowering everyone to bring their authentic selves to work and achieve their fullest potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our inclusion strategy focuses on three core areas of our business and culture:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Company: We are committed to building a merit-based organization that offers equal access to growth and success for all employees globally. Your potential is limitless here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Culture: We strive to create an inclusive atmosphere where individuals from all backgrounds feel a strong sense of belonging, can thrive, and do their best work. Your contributions help us innovate and break boundaries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Communities: We are dedicated to expanding our engagement with the communities we operate in, creating opportunities for underrepresented talent and driving greater innovation for our clients. Your impact extends beyond Rubrik, contributing to safer and stronger communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer/Veterans/Disabled&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, or protected veteran status and will not be discriminated against on the basis of disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik provides equal employment opportunities (EEO) to all employees and applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, age, disability or genetics. In addition to federal law requirements, Rubrik complies with applicable state and local laws governing nondiscrimination in employment in every location in which the company has facilities. This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, compensation and training.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Federal law requires employers to provide reasonable accommodation to qualified individuals with disabilities. Please contact us at ----- if you require a reasonable accommodation to apply for a job or to perform your job. Examples of reasonable accommodation include making a change to the application process or work procedures, providing documents in an alternate format, using a sign language interpreter, or using specialized equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO IS THE LAW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/olms/regs/compliance/eo_posters/employeerightsposter2page_19final.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;NOTIFICATION OF EMPLOYEE RIGHTS UNDER FEDERAL LABOR LAWS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Title: &lt;/strong&gt;Senior Engineer I&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Paris (Hybrid)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; €54,000 - €70,000&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Client Engineering&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting To:&lt;/strong&gt; Software Engineering Manager&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in Paris and requires an existing right to work in France. At this time, we are not able to offer visa sponsorship for this role. We are committed to building a diverse, global team and our sponsorship policy is evaluated on a role-by-role basis. We encourage you to keep an eye on our careers site to stay informed about future opportunities where we are able to offer visa sponsorship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kaluza is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today’s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our platform orchestrates millions of real-time decisions across homes, devices, markets and grids. By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable, affordable and adaptive to everyday life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With teams across Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will I be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Write clean, well-tested, and maintainable TypeScript to build and extend Kaluza’s platform for major clients including ENGIE, taking ownership of features from conception to deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud-Native Development: &lt;/strong&gt;Build, deploy, and maintain highly scalable applications on AWS Serverless (e.g., Lambda, API Gateway, DynamoDB) and help design event-driven microservices with real-time data streaming via Kafka.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Integration: &lt;/strong&gt;Identify and implement opportunities to embed AI into Kaluza’s platform and software development life-cycle - LLM-powered automation, intelligent decision support, and AI-assisted workflows. Act as an AI knowledge carrier, sharing learnings across teams and helping build a culture of AI-informed engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Quality &amp;amp; Mentorship: &lt;/strong&gt;Champion engineering best practices through thorough code reviews and upskilling junior engineers on TypeScript, serverless, and AI development patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: Collaborate closely with your team, Product Managers, and Engineering Managers to refine features, estimate tasks, and deliver value predictably.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideally you&#39;ll have/be:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TypeScript Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong professional experience building scalable, production-grade applications using TypeScript and Node.js, including on AWS Serverless architectures (Lambda, API Gateway, DynamoDB) and event-driven systems such as Kafka.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Mindset: &lt;/strong&gt;You think about AI as a practical engineering tool — curious about what’s possible, focused on what’s production-ready, and motivated to bring colleagues along with you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem-Solving Mindset: &lt;/strong&gt;A track record of creative problem-solving and delivering team-level technical expertise on complex application workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Practices: &lt;/strong&gt;A solid grasp of CI/CD pipelines, software development fundamentals, and Agile/Lean methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative Communicator: &lt;/strong&gt;Excellent communication skills and a genuine enjoyment of cross-functional teamwork, including explaining technical concepts to non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will set you apart:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LLM Integration Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Hands-on experience integrating large language models into production applications, whether via APIs (e.g., OpenAI, Anthropic, AWS Bedrock) or open-source models, with a solid understanding of prompt engineering, context management, and evaluation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Tooling Advocacy: &lt;/strong&gt;A track record of introducing AI-assisted developer tooling and workflows (e.g., Copilot, Cursor, Claude or similar) into a team and upskilling colleagues, not just using it personally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Energy or Enterprise Domain Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Background working with large enterprise applications, specifically involving billing, ledger tooling, payments integration, or energy grid/supply data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client-Facing Awareness:&lt;/strong&gt; Previous experience working on consulting, software-as-a-service (SaaS) onboarding, or client-delivery technical projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Where you&#39;ll work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer flexible working, with an expectation of 3 days a week in the office. This gives us the best of both: real time together to collaborate and build relationships, with the flexibility to work in the way that suits you best the rest of the week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Kaluza Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here at Kaluza we have five core values that guide us as a business:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Play to win, Solve the real problem, Build trust every day, Own the outcome, Go further together.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We want the best people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re keen to meet people from all walks of life — our view is that the more inclusive we are, the better our work will be. We want to build teams which represent a variety of experiences, perspectives and skills, and we recognise talent on the basis of merit and potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We understand some people may not apply for jobs unless they tick every box. But if you&#39;re excited about joining us and think you have some of what we&#39;re looking for, even if you&#39;re not 100% sure, we&#39;d still love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more about working in Kaluza on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/careers/&quot;&gt; careers page&lt;/a&gt; and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/kaluza/&quot;&gt; LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can also find our Applicant Data Protection Policy&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/applicant-data-protection-notice/&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

