&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant professional experience in product management, product strategy, technical programme leadership, or related roles, with a track record of driving complex technologies from initial concept through broad adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to navigate ambiguous, technically complex domains, owning end-to-end problem definition, business case formulation, prototyping, and user adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical fluency across infrastructure domains (e.g., networking, power, systems engineering) with demonstrated ability to translate tacit expert knowledge into formal parameters, constraints, and generative logic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on familiarity with AI-assisted development tools and coding literacy sufficient to read, shape, and test prototype outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional leadership skills with experience aligning Product, Engineering, Research, Data Science, and operational teams around shared priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep user empathy and a data-driven approach to measuring product outcomes, time savings, and capex impact against real-world metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Academic or professional background in engineering, physical research, data-centre design, networking, High-Performance Computing (HPC), or related industrial fields.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with parametric design, optimization algorithms, operations research, placement/routing logic, or combinatorial search.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with cloud infrastructure platforms, 2D/3D CAD representations, or frontend/JavaScript visualization frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
