&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Field Account Executive&amp;nbsp;is responsible for&amp;nbsp;acquiring&amp;nbsp;net new gyms and fitness operators for the&amp;nbsp;ClassPass&amp;nbsp;platform within their assigned market and broader region.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;They are embedded within their markets, building strong relationships across the fitness sector, and are the first to&amp;nbsp;identify&amp;nbsp;gyms, newly opened fitness locations,&amp;nbsp;and fitness&amp;nbsp;operators with strong brand positioning and service standards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
